# Fix process (mandatory before coding a fix)

Read [`FIXING.md`](../../FIXING.md) and [`CONSTRAINTS.md`](../../CONSTRAINTS.md) **before** implementing a bug fix.

## Required for every bug fix

1. **Constraints first** — never weaken mediation / vault / fail-closed egress; no static hostname URL passthrough lists.
2. **Reliable, not one-shot** — fix root cause **and** add startup ensure + runtime detect/recover when the failure can recur.
3. **Regression test** — add/extend `scripts/test-*.mjs` that catches this class of bug; wire a `test:*` script when appropriate.
4. **Health paths must not hang** — prefer `bash -c` (not `bash -lc`) for docker health/repair; always bound timeouts (FUSE STATs and RFB `recv` can block forever).
5. **Before completing work** — run **`npm test`** (the full suite in `package.json`). Do not finish after only a focused `test:*` script. Fix failures or report blockers; do not skip.

## Desktop black screen class

If stream-health / ensure-stream / `bash -lc` hangs: treat as FUSE-or-login-shell deadlock until proven otherwise. See `host/lib/stream-stack.js` and `scripts/test-desktop-stream.mjs`.
